        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The HOBOT-298 is HOBOT Technology's flagship window robot, built around a Bio-mimicry Ultrasonic Water Spray (an exclusive HOBOT patent). A 108KHz nozzle nebulizes water into a 15-micrometer mist that dissolves dust and polishes glass without watermarks. Place it, tie the safety rope, and let it run.</p><p><strong>Built for Serious Glass</strong><br/>AI Smart Route Plan (S2.1) auto-detects edges and runs a two-pass cleaning cycle, zigzag first, then N-shaped, for thorough coverage in a single session. A 6KG-suction Nidec brushless motor holds it firmly to the glass at just 64dB.</p><p><strong>Our Take</strong><br/>A CES 2019 Innovation Awards Honoree, and our flagship recommendation for large or hard-to-reach glass, ground floor or second story.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Curated by Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><h3>Bio-mimicry Ultrasonic Water Spray</h3><p>An exclusive HOBOT patent, the first window robot with built-in automatic spray. A 108KHz nozzle nebulizes water into 15μm micro-mist, no manual spraying, no watermarks.</p><h3>AI Smart Route Plan (S2.1)</h3><p>Auto edge detection with a two-pass cleaning cycle, zigzag then N-shaped, designed for thorough coverage in one session.</p><h3>High Reliability Design</h3><p>An auto-adjustable pneumatic pad controls driving force so dirty glass won't stall the cleaning task, and dual laser sensors measure distance and height for accurate edge detection on frameless windows.</p><h3>Safety, Built In</h3><p>A 4.5-meter safety rope rated to 150 KGf ties to any indoor fixture before use. A 20-minute UPS backup maintains suction if power is cut, sounds an alert, and notifies the HOBOT app.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by HOBOT's manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Fully charge the robot using the included power adapter before first use. Tie the 4.5-meter safety rope to a secure indoor fixture, place the robot on the glass, and power it on, the brushless motor engages suction automatically. Start cleaning with one touch from the remote control or the HOBOT app (iOS/Android). The 1m device cord plus 4m extension gives you 5 meters of power reach around the room.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Cleaning</h3><ul><li><strong>Suction force:</strong> 6.0 Kg, Nidec brushless DC motor</li><li><strong>Ultrasonic nozzle:</strong> 108 KHz, 15μm water particle size</li><li><strong>Water tank:</strong> 50 ml (replaceable)</li><li><strong>AI software:</strong> AI Technology S2.1</li><li><strong>Cleaning speed:</strong> 1 m² per 2.4 minutes</li><li><strong>Cleaning cloth:</strong> Microfiber, 24 × 24cm</li><li><strong>Noise level:</strong> 64 dB @ 1m</li></ul><h3>Safety</h3><ul><li><strong>Safety rope:</strong> 4.5m, 150 KGf rated</li><li><strong>UPS backup:</strong> 20 minutes</li><li><strong>Edge detection:</strong> Dual laser sensors</li></ul><h3>Physical &amp; Power</h3><ul><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 1.28 kg</li><li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 240 × 240 × 100mm</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> 72W, 100–240V, 50–60Hz</li><li><strong>Power reach:</strong> 5 meters (1m cord + 4m extension)</li><li><strong>Minimum window size:</strong> 40 × 40cm</li><li><strong>Control:</strong> HOBOT app (iOS/Android, Bluetooth) + remote control</li><li><strong>Compatible liquids:</strong> HOBOT detergent or pure water only</li></ul><h3>What's in the Box</h3><ul><li>HOBOT-298 Window Cleaning Robot</li><li>Power adapter (100–240V)</li><li>DC extension cord (4 meters)</li><li>Safety rope (4.5m, 150 KGf rated)</li><li>Remote control</li><li>3 microfibre cleaning cloths</li><li>User manual</li></ul><p>HOBOT glass detergent sold separately.</p>"
          }
        },
