        "question_nCTWbR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What makes the 298 different from the HOBOT-2S?",
            "answer": "<p>The 298 uses a single ultrasonic nozzle with AI Smart Route Plan software and a 6.0Kg suction motor. The 2S steps up to dual nozzles spraying in three directions, 6.5Kg suction, and 80% corner coverage. Both are capable window robots, the 2S is our recommendation for the most thorough result.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_69jhiF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it safe to use on a second-story window?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, when used as directed. The included 4.5-meter safety rope, rated to 150 KGf, must be tied to a secure indoor fixture before every use, and a 20-minute UPS backup keeps suction active even if power is interrupted.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_8KCdGW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work on frameless windows?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Dual laser sensors measure distance and height for accurate edge detection, which is what enables the 298 to work reliably on frameless glass.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_EcA6Mx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How loud is it?",
            "answer": "<p>64 dB at 1 meter, quiet enough to run while you're in the next room.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_JjXiyk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What liquid does it use?",
            "answer": "<p>HOBOT detergent or pure water only. Using other liquids can damage the spray system and isn't covered by warranty.</p>",
